(2371, 'Ainu', 'One of a peculiar race found primarily in Hokkaido in the northern part of the empire of Japan the Kurile Islands and nearby  They are believed to be the native inhabitants of the Japanese islands The Ainus are stout and short with hairy bodies  Also called Aino and hairy Ainu'),
