(4928, 'antimycin', 'one of several antibiotic substances produced by several species of Streptomyces active against various fungi They are used only experimentally not in medicine The two best known antimycins are antimycin A1 C28H40N2O9 and antimycin A3 C26H36N2O9  They are notable for their mechanism of action interference with the proton pumping mechanism of fungi'),
