(14064, 'Calcitrant', 'Kicking  Hence Stubborn refractory'),
(14065, 'Calcitrate', 'To kick'),
(14066, 'Calcitration', 'Act of kicking'),
(14067, 'Calcium', 'An elementary substance a metal which combined with oxygen forms lime It is of a pale yellow color tenacious and malleable It is a member of the alkaline earth group of elements Atomic weight 40 Symbol Ca'),
