(15514, 'Catechize', 'See Catechise'),
(15515, 'catechol', 'any of a group of chemicals having a benzene ring substituted with two hydroxyl groups in ortho position especially ortho dihydroxybenzene itself C6H6O2 also called pyrocatechol used in photography and as a reagent'),
