(22090, 'Counter paly', 'Paly and then divided fesswise so that each vertical piece is cut into two having the colors used alternately or counterchanged Thus the escutcheon in the illustration may also be blazoned paly of six per fess counterchanged argent and azure'),
(22091, 'Counterpane', 'A coverlet for a bed    originally stitched or woven in squares or figures'),
