(23781, 'Cyanosed', 'Rendered blue as the surface of the body from cyanosis or deficient a'),
(23782, 'Cyanosis', 'A condition in which from insufficient a'),
(23783, 'Cyanosite', 'Native sulphate of copper Cf Blue vitriol under Blue'),
