(30548, 'Earthquake', 'A shaking trembling or concussion of the earth due to subterranean causes often accompanied by a rumbling noise The wave of shock sometimes traverses half a hemisphere destroying cities and many thousand lives    called also earthdin earthquave and earthshock'),
