(42935, 'Halacha', 'The general term for the Hebrew oral or traditional law one of two branches of exposition in the Midrash  See Midrash'),
(42936, 'Halation', 'An appearance as of a halo of light surrounding the edges of dark objects in a photographic picture'),
(42937, 'Halberd', 'An ancient long handled weapon of which the head had a point and several long sharp edges curved or straight and sometimes additional points The heads were sometimes of very elaborate form'),
