(43179, 'handlebar', 'The curved bar connected by a shaft to the front wheel of a bicycle or motorcycle positioned nearly horizontally in front of the riders seat designed to be gripped by the rider while riding and used to steer the vehicle  Usually used in the plural as dont let go of the handlbars'),
