(44455, 'Hernia', 'A protrusion consisting of an organ or part which has escaped from its natural cavity and projects through some natural or accidental opening in the walls of the latter as hernia of the brain of the lung or of the bowels Hernia of the abdominal viscera in most common Called also rupture'),
