(44583, 'Heteromorphism', 'The state or quality of being heteromorphic'),
(44584, 'Heteromorphous', 'Heteromorphic'),
(44585, 'Heteromyaria', 'A division of bivalve shells including the marine mussels in which the two adductor muscles are very unequal See Dreissena and Illust under Byssus'),
