(45081, 'HMO', 'A health maintenance organization a form of group health insurance that entitles members to services of participating hospitals and clinics and physicians'),
(45082, 'H M S', 'A prefix used in the names of British warships meaning His Majestys Ship or Her Majestys Ship as H M S Pinafore'),
