(51770, 'Jarl', 'A chief an earl in English history one of the leaders in the Danish and Norse invasions'),
(51771, 'Jarnut', 'An earthnut'),
(51772, 'Jarosite', 'An ocher yellow mineral occurring in minute rhombohedral crystals It is a hydrous sulphate of iron and potash'),
