(55458, 'Linsang', 'Any viverrine mammal of the genus Prionodon inhabiting the East Indies and Southern Asia The common East Indian linsang Prionodon gracilis is white crossed by broad black bands The Guinea linsang Porana Richardsonii is brown with black spots'),
