(56317, 'loudspeaker', 'A device which converts electrical signals into sounds loud enough to be heard at a distance usually outdoors it is used to amplify or transmit over a distance speech from a person who is typically speaking into a microphone  Sometimes it is used to play recorded speech or music'),
