(57425, 'mainframe', 'A large digital computer serving 100 400 users and occupying a special air conditioned room  At any given point in development of computer technology the mainframe will be faster have large main memeory and be more capable than a minicomputer which will in turn be faster and more capable than a personal computer  The typical personal computer in 1999 is faster than a mainframe was in 1970'),
