(57840, 'Mammoth', 'An extinct hairy maned elephant Mammuthus primigenius formerly Elephas primigenius of enormous size remains of which are found in the northern parts of both continents  The last of the race in Europe were coeval with prehistoric man'),
(57841, 'mammothrept', 'A child brought up by its grandmother a spoiled child'),
