(57930, 'Manducatory', 'Pertaining to or employed in chewing'),
(57931, 'Manducus', 'A grotesque mask representing a person chewing or grimacing worn in processions and by comic actors on the stage'),
(57932, 'Mane', 'The long and heavy hair growing on the upper side of or about the neck of some quadrupedal animals as the horse the lion etc See Illust of Horse'),
