(59379, 'Men', 'pl of Man'),
(59380, 'Menaccanite', 'An iron black or steel gray mineral consisting chiefly of the oxides of iron and titanium It is commonly massive but occurs also in rhombohedral crystals  Called also titanic iron ore and ilmenite'),
(59381, 'Menace', 'The show of an intention to inflict evil a threat or threatening indication of a probable evil or catastrophe to come'),
