(59415, 'Meninges', 'The three membranes that envelop the brain and spinal cord the pia mater dura mater and arachnoid membrane'),
(59416, 'Meningitis', 'Inflammation of the membranes of the brain or spinal cord'),
(59417, 'Meniscal', 'Pertaining to or having the form of a meniscus'),
