(59420, 'Menispermaceous', 'Pertaining to a natural order Menispermaceae of climbing plants of which moonseed Menispermum is the type'),
(59421, 'Menispermic', 'Pertaining to or obtained from moonseed Menispermum or other plants of the same family as the Anamirta Cocculus'),
(59422, 'Menispermine', 'An alkaloid distinct from picrotoxin and obtained from the cocculus indicus the fruit of Anamirta Cocculus formerly Menispermum Cocculus as a white crystalline tasteless powder    called also menispermina'),
