(60277, 'Mignon', 'See 3d Minion'),
(60278, 'Mignonette', 'A plant Reseda odorata having greenish flowers with orange colored stamens and exhaling a delicious fragrance  In Africa it is a low shrub but further north it is usually an annual herb'),
