(61868, 'Moon culminating', 'Culminating or coming to the meredian at or about the same time with the moon    said of a star or stars esp of certain stars selected beforehand and named in an ephemeris as the Nautical Almanac as suitable to be observed in connection with the moon at culmination for determining terrestrial longitude'),
