(62304, 'Mouse', 'Any one of numerous species of small rodents belonging to the genus Mus and various related genera of the family Muridae  The common house mouse Mus musculus is found in nearly all countries  The American white footed mouse or deer mouse Peromyscus leucopus formerly Hesperomys leucopus sometimes lives in houses  See Dormouse Meadow mouse under Meadow and Harvest mouse under Harvest'),
