(67159, 'Orthis', 'An extinct genus of Brachiopoda abundant in the Paleozoic rocks'),
(67160, 'Orthite', 'A variety of allanite occurring in slender prismatic crystals'),
(67161, 'Orthocarbonic', 'Designating a complex ether COC2H54 which is obtained as a liquid of a pleasant ethereal odor by means of chlorpicrin and is believed to be a derivative of the hypothetical normal carbonic acid COH4'),
