(69080, 'Pancreas', 'The sweetbread a gland connected with the intestine of nearly all vertebrates It is usually elongated and light colored and its secretion called the pancreatic juice is discharged often together with the bile into the upper part of the intestines and is a powerful aid in digestion See Illust of Digestive apparatus'),
