(69661, 'parimutuel', 'A form of betting where winners share the total amount wagered in proporation to their bets and less a portion for the management    used commonly in betting at horse racing track  In parimutuel betting the payoff for a bet does not have fixed odds but depends on the amount bet on each outcome'),
