(69776, 'parse', 'To resolve into its elements as a sentence pointing out the several parts of speech and their relation to each other by government or agreement to analyze and describe grammatically'),
(69777, 'parsec', 'A unit of length used in describing astronomical distances equal to 326 light years or 3086 x 1013 km  Abbreviated pc  The derived units of kiloparsec kpc 1000 parsecs and megaparsec mpc one million parsecs are often found in discussion of astronomical distances'),
