(69828, 'Participially', 'In the sense or manner of a participle'),
(69829, 'Participle', 'A part of speech partaking of the nature of both verb and adjective a form of a verb or verbal adjective modifying a noun but taking the adjuncts of the verb from which it is derived In the sentences a letter is written being asleep he did not hear exhausted by toil he will sleep soundly    written being and exhaustedare participles'),
