(70384, 'pectin', 'One of a series of carbohydrates commonly called vegetable jelly found very widely distributed in the vegetable kingdom especially in ripe fleshy fruits as apples cranberries etc  It is extracted as variously colored translucent substances which are soluble in hot water but become viscous on cooling  It is commonly used in making fruit jelllies'),
