(70510, 'Pedometer', 'An instrument for including the number of steps in walking and so ascertaining the distance passed over  It is usually in the form of a watch an oscillating weight by the motion of the body causes the index to advance a certain distance at each step'),
(70511, 'Pedometric', 'Pertaining to or measured by a pedometer'),
