(70729, 'Penguin', 'Any bird of the order Impennes or Ptilopteri  They are covered with short thick feathers almost scalelike on the wings which are without true quills  They are unable to fly but use their wings to aid in diving in which they are very expert  See King penguin under Jackass'),
