(72149, 'Phoronomia', 'See Phoronomics'),
(72150, 'Phoronomics', 'The science of motion kinematics'),
(72151, 'Phosgene', 'Producing or produced by the action of light    used specifically to designate a gas also called carbonyl chloride  See phosgene n and Carbonyl'),
(72152, 'Phosgenite', 'A rare mineral occurring in tetragonal crystals of a white yellow or grayish color and adamantine luster  It is a chlorocarbonate of lead'),
