(72202, 'Photochromy', 'The art or process of reproducing colors by photography'),
(72203, 'Photochronograph', 'An instrument for recording minute intervals of time The record is made by the power of a magnetic field due to an electric signaling current to turn the plane of polarization of light A flash coinciding in time and duration with the signal is thus produced and is photographed on a moving plate'),
