(72945, 'Pioneering', 'groundbreaking originating    of efforts that begin work in a field or on a topic not previously widely known'),
(72946, 'Pioneers Day', 'In Utah a legal holiday July 24 commemorated the arrival in 1847 of Brigham Young and his followers at the present site of Salt Lake City'),
