(73071, 'Piston', 'A sliding piece which either is moved by or moves against fluid pressure It usually consists of a short cylinder fitting within a cylindrical vessel along which it moves back and forth It is used in steam engines to receive motion from the steam and in pumps to transmit motion to a fluid also for other purposes'),
