(73076, 'Pitapat', 'In a flutter with palpitation or quick succession of beats'),
(73077, 'Pitch', 'A thick black lustrous and sticky substance obtained by boiling down tar It is used in calking the seams of ships also in coating rope canvas wood ironwork etc to preserve them'),
