(74668, 'Positivism', 'A system of philosophy originated by M Auguste Comte which deals only with positives It excludes from philosophy everything but the natural phenomena or properties of knowable things together with their invariable relations of coexistence and succession as occurring in time and space Such relations are denominated laws which are to be discovered by observation experiment and comparison This philosophy holds all inquiry into causes both efficient and final to be useless and unprofitable'),
