(76844, 'Pseudo ', 'A combining form or prefix signifying false counterfeit pretended spurious as pseudo apostle a false apostle pseudo clergy false or spurious clergy pseudo episcopacy pseudo form pseudo martyr pseudo philosopher Also used adjectively'),
