(76873, 'Pseudoneuroptera', 'division of insects Zool reticulated wings as in the Neuroptera but having an active pupa state It includes the dragon flies May flies white ants etc By some Zoologists they are classed with the Orthoptera by others with the Neuroptera'),
(76874, 'Pseudoneuropterous', 'Of or pertaining to the Pseudoneuroptera'),
(76875, 'Pseudonym', 'A fictitious name assumed for the time as by an author a pen name an alias'),
