(79520, 'Redsear', 'To be brittle when red hot to be red short'),
(79521, 'Redshank', 'A common Old World limicoline bird Totanus calidris having the legs and feet pale red The spotted redshank Totanus fuscus is larger and has orange red legs Called also redshanks redleg and clee'),
