(79666, 'Refind', 'To find again to get or experience again'),
(79667, 'Refine', 'To reduce to a fine unmixed or pure state to free from impurities to free from dross or alloy to separate from extraneous matter to purify to defecate as to refine gold or silver to refine iron to refine wine or sugar'),
