(82544, 'Run', 'To move proceed advance pass go come etc swiftly smoothly or with quick action    said of things animate or inanimate Hence to flow glide or roll onward as a stream a snake a wagon etc to move by quicker action than in walking as a person a horse a dog'),
(82545, 'Runagate', 'A fugitive a vagabond an apostate a renegade See Renegade'),
