(83135, 'Samarskite', 'A rare mineral having a velvet black color and submetallic luster It is a niobate of uranium iron and the yttrium and cerium metals'),
(83136, 'Sambo', 'A negro sometimes the offspring of a black person and a mulatto    formerly used colloquially or with humorous intent but now considered offensive or racist by African Americans'),
