(83213, 'Sandiver', 'A whitish substance which is cast up as a scum from the materials of glass in fusion and floating on the top is skimmed off    called also glass gall'),
(83214, 'Sandix', 'A kind of minium or red lead made by calcining carbonate of lead but inferior to true minium'),
