(83340, 'Sapotaceous', 'Of or pertaining to a natural order Sapotaceae of mostly tropical trees and shrubs including the star apple the Lucuma or natural marmalade tree the gutta percha tree Isonandra and the India mahwa as well as the sapodilla or sapota after which the order is named'),
