(83985, 'Schorly', 'Pertaining to or containing schorl as schorly granite'),
(83986, 'Schottish', 'A Scotch round dance in 2 4 time similar to the polka only slower also the music for such a dance    not to be confounded with the '),
(83987, 'Schreibersite', 'A mineral occurring in steel gray flexible folia It contains iron nickel and phosphorus and is found only in meteoric iron'),
