(83999, 'Sciatheric', 'Belonging to a sundial'),
(84000, 'Sciatic', 'Of or pertaining to the hip in the region of or affecting the hip ischial ischiatic as the sciatic nerve sciatic pains'),
(84001, 'Sciatica', 'Neuralgia of the sciatic nerve an affection characterized by paroxysmal attacks of pain in the buttock back of the thigh or in the leg or foot following the course of the branches of the sciatic nerve The name is also popularly applied to various painful affections of the hip and the parts adjoining it See Ischiadic passion under Ischiadic'),
