(85724, 'Septillion', 'According to the French method of numeration which is followed also in the United States the number expressed by a unit with twenty four ciphers annexed According to the English method the number expressed by a unit with forty two ciphers annexed See Numeration'),
(85725, 'Septimole', 'A group of seven notes to be played in the time of four or six'),
