(86413, 'Shiah', 'Same as Shiite when used with a plural verb the Shiites collectively'),
(86414, 'Shibboleth', 'A word which was made the criterion by which to distinguish the Ephraimites from the Gileadites The Ephraimites not being able to pronounce sh called the word sibboleth See Judges xii'),
