(88160, 'Sneerful', 'Given to sneering'),
(88161, 'Sneeringly', 'In a sneering manner'),
(88162, 'Sneeze', 'To emit air chiefly through the nose audibly and violently by a kind of involuntary convulsive force occasioned by irritation of the inner membrane of the nose'),
