(89444, 'Spiderlike', 'Like a spider'),
(89445, 'Spider stitch', 'A stitch in lace making used to fill in open spaces with threads resembling a cobweb'),
(89446, 'Spider web', 'The silken web which is formed by most kinds of spiders particularly the web spun to entrap their prey    also called cobweb See Geometric spider Triangle spider under Geometric and Triangle'),
