(89529, 'Spinstry', 'The business of one who spins spinning'),
(89530, 'Spinthariscope', 'A small instrument containing a minute particle of a radium compound mounted in front of a fluorescent screen and viewed with magnifying lenses The tiny flashes produced by the continual bombardment of the screen by the '),
