(90771, 'Stey', 'See Stee'),
(90772, 'Sthenic', 'Strong active    said especially of morbid states attended with excessive action of the heart and blood vessels and characterized by strength and activity of the muscular and nervous system as a sthenic fever'),
(90773, 'Stiacciato', 'The lowest relief    often used in Italian sculpture of the 15th and 16th centuries'),
