(90818, 'Stiff necked', 'Stubborn inflexibly obstinate contumacious as stiff necked pride a stiff necked people'),
(90819, 'Stiff neckedness', 'The quality or state of being stiff necked stubbornness'),
(90820, 'Stiffness', 'The quality or state of being stiff as the stiffness of cloth or of paste stiffness of manner stiffness of character'),
(90821, 'Stifftail', 'The ruddy duck'),
(90822, 'Stiff tailed', 'Having the quill feathers of the tail somewhat rigid'),
(90823, 'Stifle', 'The joint next above the hock and near the flank in the hind leg of the horse and allied animals the joint corresponding to the knee in man    called also stifle joint See Illust under Horse'),
