(90906, 'Stinkweed', 'Stramonium See Jamestown weed and Datura'),
(90907, 'Stinkwood', 'A name given to several kinds of wood with an unpleasant smell as that of the Foetidia Mauritiana of the Mauritius and that of the South African Ocotea bullata'),
(90908, 'Stint', 'Any one of several species of small sandpipers as the sanderling of Europe and America the dunlin the little stint of India Tringa minuta etc Called also pume'),
