(92388, 'Suitable', 'Capable of suiting fitting accordant proper becoming agreeable adapted as ornaments suitable to ones station language suitable for the subject'),
(92389, 'Suite', 'A retinue or company of attendants as of a distinguished personage as the suite of an ambassador See Suit n 5'),
