(93280, 'Swedenborgian', 'One who holds the doctrines of the New Jerusalem church as taught by Emanuel Swedenborg a Swedish philosopher and religious writer who was born a d 1688 and died 1772 Swedenborg claimed to have intercourse with the spiritual world through the opening of his spiritual senses in 1745 He taught that the Lord Jesus Christ as comprehending in himself all the fullness of the Godhead is the one only God and that there is a spiritual sense to the Scriptures which he Swedenborg was able to reveal because he saw the correspondence between natural and spiritual things'),
