(93413, 'Sword', 'An offensive weapon having a long and usually sharp pointed blade with a cutting edge or edges It is the general term including the small sword rapier saber scimiter and many other varieties'),
(93414, 'Swordbill', 'A humming bird Docimastes ensiferus having a very long slender bill exceeding the length of the body of the bird'),
