(93416, 'Sworder', 'One who uses or fights with a sword a swordsman a soldier a cutthroat'),
(93417, 'Swordfish', 'A very large oceanic fish Xiphias gladius the only representative of the family Xiphiidae It is highly valued as a food fish The bones of the upper jaw are consolidated and form a long rigid swordlike beak the dorsal fin is high and without distinct spines the ventral fins are absent The adult is destitute of teeth It becomes sixteen feet or more long'),
