(93644, 'Synecdoche', 'A figure or trope by which a part of a thing is put for the whole as fifty sail for fifty ships or the whole for a part as the smiling year for spring the species for the genus as cutthroat for assassin the genus for the species as a creature for a man the name of the material for the thing made etc'),
(93645, 'Synecdochical', 'Expressed by synecdoche implying a synecdoche'),
