(94388, 'Tautomeric', 'Relating to or characterized by tautomerism'),
(94389, 'Tautomerism', 'The condition quality or relation of metameric substances or their respective derivatives which are more or less interchangeable according as one form or the other is the more stable It is a special case of metamerism thus the lactam and the lactim compounds exhibit tautomerism'),
