(94663, 'Telephotographic', 'Designating or pertaining to the process of telephotography'),
(94664, 'Telephotography', 'The photography of distant objects in more enlarged form than is possible by the ordinary means usually by a camera provided with a telephoto lens or mounted in place of the eyepiece of a telescope so that the real or a magnified image falls on the sensitive plate'),
