(96205, 'Tillandsia', 'An immense genus of epiphytic bromeliaceous plants confined to tropical and subtropical America They usually bear a rosette of narrow overlapping basal leaves which often hold a considerable quantity of water The spicate or paniculate flowers have free perianth segments and are often subtended by colored bracts Also a plant of this genus'),
