(96259, 'Time signature', 'A sign at the beginning of a composition or movement placed after the key signature to indicate its time or meter Also called rhythmical signature It is in the form of a fraction of which the denominator indicates the kind of note taken as time unit for the beat and the numerator the number of these to the measure'),
