(98201, 'Trochoid', 'The curve described by any point in a wheel rolling on a line a cycloid a roulette in general the curve described by any point fixedly connected with a moving curve while the moving curve rolls without slipping on a second fixed curve the curves all being in one plane Cycloids epicycloids hypocycloids cardioids etc are all trochoids'),
