(105041, 'Vultern', 'The brush turkey Talegallus Lathami of Australia  See Brush turkey'),
(105042, 'Vulture', 'Any one of numerous species of rapacious birds belonging to Vultur Cathartes Catharista and various other genera of the family Vulturidae'),
(105043, 'Vulturine', 'Of or pertaining to a vulture resembling a vulture in qualities or looks as the vulturine sea eagle Gypohierax Angolensis vulturine rapacity'),
(105044, 'Vulturish', 'Vulturous'),
