(105717, 'Waxbill', 'Any one of numerous species of finchlike birds belonging to Estrelda and allied genera native of Asia Africa and Australia The bill is large conical and usually red in color resembling sealing wax Several of the species are often kept as cage birds'),
(105718, 'Waxbird', 'The waxwing'),
