(106991, 'World wide', 'Extended throughout the world as world wide fame'),
(106992, 'world wide web', 'The collective total of all computer installations that are connected to the internet and provide access to other computers connected to the internet using hypertext transfer protocol to computer files called web pages which may have text graphics audio or animated video data as well as pages which may provide data or information in all those forms'),
