(107207, 'Xanthogenic', 'Producing a yellow color or compound xanthic  See Xanthic acid under Xanthic'),
(107208, 'Xanthoma', 'A skin disease marked by the development or irregular yellowish patches upon the skin especially upon the eyelids    called also xanthelasma'),
