(107312, 'Xylidic', 'Pertaining to or designating either one of two distinct acids which are derived from xylic acid and related compounds and are metameric with uvitic acid'),
(107313, 'Xylidine', 'Any one of six metameric hydrocarbons CH32C6H3NH2 resembling aniline and related to xylene They are liquids or easily fusible crystalline substances of which three are derived from metaxylene two from orthoxylene and one from paraxylene They are called the amido xylenes'),
