(107462, 'year round', 'operating or continuing throughout the year as a year round resort a year round job  Antonym of seasonal'),
(107463, 'Years purchase', 'The amount that is yielded by the annual income of property    used in expressing the value of a thing in the number of years required for its income to yield its purchase price in reckoning the amount to be paid for annuities etc'),
