(107542, 'Yex', 'To hiccough'),
(107543, 'Yezdegerdian', 'Of or pertaining to Yezdegerd the last Sassanian monarch of Persia who was overthrown by the Muslims as the Yezdegerdian era which began on the 16th of June a d 632 The era is still used by the Parsees'),
(107544, 'Yezdi', 'Same as Izedi'),
