(107552, 'Yid', 'A Jew    now 1998 usually considered offensive or contemptuous'),
(107553, 'Yiddish', 'A language used by German and other Jews being a Middle German dialect developed under Hebrew and Slavic influence It is written in Hebrew characters'),
