(107562, 'Yin', 'A Chinese weight of 2'),
(107563, 'yin and yang', 'the two fundamental principles one negative dark passive cold wet and feminine yin and the other yang positive bright active dry hot and masculine  The interactions and balance of these forces in people and nature influence their behavior and fate'),
